<!--
  mbnavadjust_biases.ui - Settings > Biases of the analysis window of the navigation adjustment tool
  (mbnavadjust's bulletinBoard_biases, mbnavadjust_creation.c): heading and roll biases of the two
  sections' files, the same for both or each its own. Loaded at runtime by
  src/mbnavadjust/mbnavadjust_window.cpp. Absolute geometry from the Motif bulletin board, no layouts.
  Each Motif XmScale (titled, showValue on, one decimal) is a title label, a slider, and a label
  named after it + "Value".
-->
